# New Subscription UI Design Implementation

Implement the new subscription management UI as shown in the 9 design images, updating both the **Vendor App (Flutter)** and **Admin Panel (PHP)**.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Schema Migration

#### [NEW] [migration_subscription_ui_v2.sql](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/database/migration_subscription_ui_v2.sql)

Add new columns to the `subscriptions` table required by the new UI:

```sql
ALTER TABLE subscriptions
  ADD COLUMN duration_months INT DEFAULT 0 AFTER duration_days,
  ADD COLUMN plan_session_year VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT NULL AFTER duration_months,
  ADD COLUMN promo_code VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN promo_text VARCHAR(255) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN plan_title VARCHAR(255) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN recommended TINYINT(1) DEFAULT 0,
  ADD COLUMN terms_link VARCHAR(500) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN box_color VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN box_border_color VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN text_color VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN plan_icon VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'crown',
  ADD COLUMN feature_included TEXT DEFAULT NULL COMMENT 'JSON array of included feature indices';
```

