### Admin Panel – Subscription Model

#### [MODIFY] [Subscription.php](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/models/Subscription.php)

- Add new public properties: `$duration_months`, `$plan_session_year`, `$promo_code`, `$promo_text`, `$plan_title`, `$recommended`, `$terms_link`, `$box_color`, `$box_border_color`, `$text_color`, `$plan_icon`, `$feature_included`
