### Admin Panel – Subscription Plans Page

#### [MODIFY] [subscriptions.php](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/admin/subscriptions.php)

Complete rewrite to match the new design:

**Plan Cards Grid:**
- Each plan shown as a color-coded card with its own border color (matching the design: pink for Go Plan, light blue for Up Plan, orange for Prime Plan, red/green for inactive plans)
- Active/Inactive status badge in top-right corner
- Plan name styled in italic bold with unique color per plan
- Details: Plan Name, Price (৳), Duration (Month), Plan Session Year
- Action buttons: Edit, Disable/Enable, Delete

**Edit Plan Modal (large, `modal-xl`):**
- Left column: Edit form (Plan Name, Duration Month, Price, Plan Session Year, Promo Code, Promo Text, Plan Title, Features as numbered list with ✓/✗ toggle, Recommended toggle, Terms Link)
- Right column: Live preview showing exactly how the plan card would look in the vendor app
- Bottom section: Color Settings (Box Color, Text Color, Recommended Box/Text Color, Promo colors)
- Close + Update Plan buttons

**Add Plan Modal** updated similarly.

