### API – Get Plans Endpoint

#### [MODIFY] [get_plans.php](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/api/v1/subscription/get_plans.php)

Return the new fields:
- `duration_months`, `plan_session_year`, `promo_code`, `promo_text`, `plan_title`, `recommended`
- `terms_link`, `box_color`, `box_border_color`, `text_color`, `plan_icon`
- `feature_included` (JSON array of which features are "included" vs "not included")

