### API – Vendor Subscription Info

#### [NEW] [get_vendor_subscription.php](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/api/v1/subscription/get_vendor_subscription.php)

New endpoint (requires JWT auth) that returns:
- Current vendor's active subscription details (plan name, start/end date, status: Active/Expired/Pending/None)
- Shop name, vendor unique ID, duration months, plan session year
- Monthly progress calculation

