### Vendor App – Subscription Screen (Complete Rewrite)

#### [MODIFY] [subscription_screen.dart](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/vendorapp/lib/screens/subscription/subscription_screen.dart)

Complete rewrite to match the 7 vendor app design images:

**Vendor Subscription Status Card (top):**
- Shows shop name, vendor ID, plan name, duration, plan expired date, plan session year
- Status badge: Active (green), Expired (red), Pending (orange)
- Monthly progress bar (1-12 months with filled/unfilled indicators)
- "GAS LAGBE TERMS AND CONDITIONS" link

**Plan Selector Section:**
- 3 expandable plan cards: Go Plan, Up Plan, Prime Plan
- Each card styled as a rounded pill button with arrow icon
- "RECOMMENDED" badge on featured plan
- Tapping expands to show plan details:
  - Plan Name, Price (৳), Duration (Month), Plan Session Year
  - VIP icon for premium plans
  - Plan title: "What you have in [Plan Name]?"
  - Feature list with ✓ (green check for included) and ✗ (grey X for not included)
  - Promo offer text with promo code display + copy button
  - Terms link

**Conditional States:**
- Active: Normal view with plan details
- Expired: Red status + "Your Plan Is Expired Buy A New Plan…" warning
- Pending: "New Vendor! Buy a Plan to Active Gas Lagbe Vendor App"

**Bottom:**
- Pay button (full width, dark blue)
- Support button (pill shaped, with bot icon)
- Bottom navigation bar (Dashboard, Orders, Products, Profile)

