## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

1. **Flutter analyze** — Run `flutter analyze` in the vendorapp directory to ensure no compilation errors:
   ```bash
   cd "d:\flutter project\Gas User and Vendor App\vendorapp"
   flutter analyze --no-pub
   ```

### Manual Verification

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Since this project connects to a live PHP backend, full end-to-end testing requires the server to be running. The following manual checks are recommended:

1. **Admin Panel**: After deploying the updated PHP files, open Subscription Plans page and verify:
   - Plan cards display with color-coded borders
   - Edit modal shows live preview on the right
   - Color settings section appears at bottom of edit modal
   - Adding/editing/deleting plans works correctly

2. **Vendor App**: Build the APK and test on device:
   - Subscription screen shows vendor status card with correct status
   - Plan cards expand/collapse correctly
   - Feature list shows ✓/✗ icons correctly
   - Promo code displays and copy button works
   - Pay navigates to payment screen with correct plan data
   - Payment form fields auto-fill from vendor profile
